#. Translators: The name of the category of this add-on's commands in the Input Gestures dialog.
#. Translators: The title of this add-on's panel in NVDA's settings dialog.
msgid "NVDA MCP"
msgstr "NVDA MCP"

#. Translators: A checkbox in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "&Let MCP clients, such as AI assistants, connect to NVDA"
msgstr "&Izinkan klien MCP, seperti asisten AI, terhubung ke NVDA"

#. Translators: A checkbox in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "Allow MCP clients to &press keys"
msgstr "Izinkan klien MCP &menekan tombol"

#. Translators: A checkbox in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "&Ask before the first key press after NVDA starts"
msgstr "&Tanyakan sebelum penekanan tombol pertama setelah NVDA dimulai"

#. Translators: A spin control in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "Number of spoken &messages to remember:"
msgstr "Jumlah &ucapan yang diingat:"

#. Translators: Reported when an NVDA MCP command is used but the add-on is not running.
msgid "NVDA MCP is off. Turn it on in NVDA Settings, NVDA MCP category."
msgstr "NVDA MCP mati. Nyalakan di Pengaturan NVDA, kategori NVDA MCP."

#. Translators: Describes a command in the Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Reports whether NVDA MCP is running and whether it may press keys"
msgstr "Melaporkan apakah NVDA MCP berjalan dan apakah boleh menekan tombol"

#. Translators: Reported by the status command when key presses are allowed.
msgid "may press keys"
msgstr "boleh menekan tombol"

#. Translators: Reported by the status command when key presses are not allowed.
msgid "read only"
msgstr "hanya baca"

#. Translators: Reported by the status command. {port} is a network port number, {control} describes permissions.
msgid "NVDA MCP running on port {port}, {control}"
msgstr "NVDA MCP berjalan di port {port}, {control}"

#. Translators: Describes a command in the Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Stops MCP clients from pressing keys until you approve again"
msgstr "Menghentikan klien MCP menekan tombol sampai Anda menyetujui lagi"

#. Translators: Reported after the user revokes permission to press keys.
msgid "Key press permission revoked"
msgstr "Izin menekan tombol dicabut"

#. Translators: Says who wants to press keys, in the dialog asking to allow it.
#. {client} is the name the program gives itself, such as Claude Code; NVDA cannot verify it.
msgid "An MCP client calling itself {client}"
msgstr "Klien MCP yang menyebut dirinya {client}"

#. Translators: Says who wants to press keys, when the program gave no name.
msgid "An MCP client, such as an AI assistant,"
msgstr "Sebuah klien MCP, misalnya asisten AI,"

#. Translators: Asks the user whether an AI assistant may press keys through NVDA.
#. {who} is who is asking, such as "An MCP client calling itself Claude Code".
msgid ""
"{who} wants to press keys on this computer through NVDA, for example to "
"move through an application with Tab. Keys go to whichever window is "
"active.\n"
"\n"
"Allow this until NVDA restarts?"
msgstr ""
"{who} ingin menekan tombol di komputer ini melalui NVDA, misalnya untuk "
"berpindah di dalam aplikasi dengan Tab. Tombol dikirim ke jendela mana pun "
"yang sedang aktif.\n"
"\n"
"Izinkan sampai NVDA dimulai ulang?"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog asking to allow an MCP client to press keys.
#. {client} is the name the program gives itself, such as Claude Code.
msgid "NVDA MCP: allow {client} to press keys?"
msgstr "NVDA MCP: izinkan {client} menekan tombol?"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog asking to allow an MCP client to press keys, when it gave no name.
msgid "NVDA MCP: allow an MCP client to press keys?"
msgstr "NVDA MCP: izinkan klien MCP menekan tombol?"

#. Translators: Reported when the user did not answer in time whether an MCP client may press keys.
msgid "NVDA MCP stopped waiting for your answer, so no keys were pressed."
msgstr "NVDA MCP berhenti menunggu jawaban Anda, jadi tidak ada tombol yang ditekan."

#. Translators: A text field in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "Only let MCP clients control these &applications (comma separated, empty for all):"
msgstr "Hanya izinkan klien MCP mengontrol &aplikasi ini (pisahkan dengan koma, kosongkan untuk semua):"

#. Translators: A checkbox in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "&Keep a log of every action MCP clients take"
msgstr "&Catat setiap aksi yang dilakukan klien MCP"

#. Translators: Describes a command in the Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Opens the log of actions MCP clients have taken"
msgstr "Membuka catatan aksi yang telah dilakukan klien MCP"

#. Translators: Reported when the user opens the action log before any action was recorded.
msgid "No actions have been logged yet"
msgstr "Belum ada aksi yang dicatat"

#. Translators: An MCP client in the NVDA MCP settings panel's list of clients to set up.
msgid "Claude Code"
msgstr "Claude Code"

#. Translators: An MCP client in the NVDA MCP settings panel's list of clients to set up.
msgid "Codex CLI"
msgstr "Codex CLI"

#. Translators: In the NVDA MCP settings panel's list of clients to set up:
#. clients configured with a JSON settings file instead of a command.
msgid "Claude Desktop, Cursor and others (JSON settings)"
msgstr "Claude Desktop, Cursor, dan lainnya (pengaturan JSON)"

#. Translators: A list in the NVDA MCP settings panel, choosing the program to set up.
msgid "Set up this MCP &client:"
msgstr "Siapkan &klien MCP ini:"

#. Translators: A button in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "C&opy setup command"
msgstr "Sal&in perintah penyiapan"

#. Translators: Reported after copying an MCP client's JSON settings in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "Settings copied. Paste them into the client's MCP settings file."
msgstr "Pengaturan disalin. Tempelkan ke file pengaturan MCP milik klien tersebut."

#. Translators: A button in the NVDA MCP settings panel that opens the author's PayPal page in a web browser.
msgid "&Donate to support NVDA MCP (opens PayPal)"
msgstr "&Donasi untuk mendukung NVDA MCP (membuka PayPal)"

#. Translators: Reported after copying a setup command in the NVDA MCP settings panel.
msgid "Setup command copied. Paste it into a command prompt and press Enter."
msgstr "Perintah penyiapan disalin. Tempelkan ke command prompt lalu tekan Enter."

#. Translators: A checkbox in the NVDA MCP settings panel. Remote debugging is a setting of Chrome and Brave.
msgid "Let MCP clients read the &HTML of web pages through the browser's remote debugging"
msgstr "Izinkan klien MCP membaca &HTML halaman web melalui remote debugging browser"

#. Translators: A checkbox in the NVDA MCP settings panel. The pictures are sent to the AI assistant.
msgid "Let MCP clients take pictures of controls on the &screen"
msgstr "Izinkan klien MCP mengambil &gambar kontrol di layar"

#. Translators: Said before an MCP client connects to a web browser's remote debugging.
#. {browser} is the browser's name, such as Brave or Google Chrome.
msgid ""
"NVDA MCP is connecting to {browser} to read this web page. {browser} will "
"ask whether to allow remote debugging."
msgstr ""
"NVDA MCP sedang tersambung ke {browser} untuk membaca halaman web ini. "
"{browser} akan menanyakan apakah remote debugging diizinkan."
